# A Luxel library scene — Apache-2.0. Grammar: library/README.md.
# Rainbow-filled letters, the multiply recipe: WHITE text on a BLACK band,
# then a rainbow ABOVE them in `multiply`, boxed to the band. White x pattern
# = pattern, black x pattern = black, so the colours show only in the glyphs.
# (`mask` on a text layer cannot do this: text is always black-keyed.)
S - Painted Letters
L pat 0 0 0 0 normal 100 none fill 1
N Aurora
I @pat/aurora-2d
L color 0 10 0 12 normal 100 none fill 1
N Band
L text 0 12 0 0 normal 100 black fill 1
N Letters
T lit HELLO WORLD
F large ffffff l left 16
L pat 0 10 0 12 multiply 100 none fill 1
N Paint
I @pat/rainbow
